      <Docs>
        <summary>Authentication type for GBA Network Application Functions (NAF) key External Challenge.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>Authentication type for GBA Network Application Functions (NAF) key External Challenge. Pass this authentication type into the getIccAuthentication(int, int, String) API to perform a GBA Network Applications Functions (NAF) key External challenge using the NAF_ID parameter as the data in base64 encoding. This method will return the Ks_Ext_Naf key in base64 encoding when ICC authentication is completed. Ref 3GPP 33.220 Section 5.3.2.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/telephony/TelephonyManager#AUTHTYPE_GBA_NAF_KEY_EXTERNAL" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.telephony.TelephonyManager.AUTHTYPE_GBA_NAF_KEY_EXTERNAL</code>.</a></format></para>
